{
  "name": {
    "zh-CN": "Sing-box 监控",
    "en": "Sing-box Monitor"
  },
  "short": "sbmonitor",
  "description": {
    "zh-CN": "在 Komari 中集中查看多台服务器的 Sing-box 端口、流量、状态与异常日志，并可按入站为指定用户做上线/会话监控和 Telegram 通知。",
    "en": "Monitor Sing-box ports, traffic, status and warning logs across servers, with per-inbound user online/session tracking and Telegram alerts."
  },
  "author": "K23Flux",
  "url": "https://github.com/K23Flux/komari-singbox-monitor",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "komari": ">=1.4.3",
  "entry": "script.js",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "permissions": {
    "node": true,
    "allowRoutes": true,
    "timeout": 30,
    "maxHTTPBodyBytes": 1048576
  },
  "configuration": {
    "type": "managed",
    "data": [
      {
        "key": "timezone_offset",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "统计时区（UTC 偏移）",
          "en": "Statistics timezone (UTC offset)"
        },
        "type": "number",
        "default": 8,
        "help": {
          "zh-CN": "中国大陆填写 8，用于划分今日和本月流量。",
          "en": "Used to calculate daily and monthly traffic boundaries."
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "offline_seconds",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "离线判定秒数",
          "en": "Offline threshold in seconds"
        },
        "type": "number",
        "default": 60
      },
      {
        "key": "history_days",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "分钟历史保留天数",
          "en": "Minute history retention days"
        },
        "type": "number",
        "default": 30
      },
      {
        "key": "watch_rules",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "监控用户（入站 tag=显示名）",
          "en": "Watched users (inbound tag=label)"
        },
        "type": "string",
        "default": "",
        "help": {
          "zh-CN": "用逗号或换行分隔，例如 ss2022_alice=alice。只有列出的入站 tag 才会做上线/会话监控和通知。",
          "en": "Comma or newline separated, e.g. ss2022_alice=alice. Only listed inbound tags get online tracking and alerts."
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "session_idle_seconds",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "会话空闲判定秒数",
          "en": "Session idle timeout in seconds"
        },
        "type": "number",
        "default": 300,
        "help": {
          "zh-CN": "仅用于 0.3.0 之前的探针或开了 multiplex 的入站：无新连接超过该秒数即视为下线。",
          "en": "Only for agents before 0.3.0 or multiplex inbounds: a session ends when no new connections arrive within this many seconds."
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "offline_grace_seconds",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "下线确认秒数",
          "en": "Offline grace in seconds"
        },
        "type": "number",
        "default": 60,
        "help": {
          "zh-CN": "所有连接都断开、且这段时间内没有新连接，才判定下线。下线时间按最后一条连接断开的时刻算。",
          "en": "A session ends once every connection has closed and no new one appears within this many seconds. The end time is when the last connection closed."
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "online_confirm_seconds",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "上线确认秒数",
          "en": "Online confirmation in seconds"
        },
        "type": "number",
        "default": 15,
        "help": {
          "zh-CN": "出现第 2 条真实连接，或单条连接保持超过该秒数，才推送上线；只有一条转瞬即逝的后台请求不算上线。填 0 表示第一条真实连接就算上线。",
          "en": "Online is announced on the second real connection, or when a single connection stays open this long. 0 announces on the first real connection."
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "tg_bot_token",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "Telegram Bot Token",
          "en": "Telegram bot token"
        },
        "type": "string",
        "default": "",
        "help": {
          "zh-CN": "找 @BotFather 创建 bot 获得。留空则不推送。",
          "en": "From @BotFather. Leave empty to disable push."
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "tg_chat_id",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "Telegram Chat ID",
          "en": "Telegram chat ID"
        },
        "type": "string",
        "default": ""
      },
      {
        "key": "notify_online",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "上线时推送",
          "en": "Notify on online"
        },
        "type": "switch",
        "default": true
      },
      {
        "key": "notify_offline",
        "name": {
          "zh-CN": "下线时推送",
          "en": "Notify on offline"
        },
        "type": "switch",
        "default": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "pages": [
    {
      "file": "watch.html",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "连接监控",
        "en": "Connection Watch"
      },
      "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
      "visibility": "admin"
    },
    {
      "file": "admin.html",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Sing-box 流量",
        "en": "Sing-box Traffic"
      },
      "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
      "visibility": "admin"
    }
  ]
}
